= 110\n\\]\n\nNext, add the result to 26:\n\n\\[\n110 + 26 = 136\n\\]\n\nThe total number of existing toys before adding the bouncy balls is 136. The total number of toys after adding the bouncy balls is 176. Therefore, the number of bouncy balls is:\n\n\\[\n176 - 136 = 40\n\\]\n\nThe number of bouncy balls in the tube is \\boxed{40}.", "model_answer": 40.0, "ground_truth": 40.0, "is_correct": true}
