ch part separately and then summing them up gives the total cost. No, I don't see any errors here. So the answer should be 48 cents.\n</think>\n\nA 90-minute call consists of two segments: the first 30 minutes at ₺0.6 per minute and the remaining 60 minutes at ₺0.5 per minute.\n\n1. **Cost for the first 30 minutes:**  \n   \\( 30 \\times 0.6 = 18 \\) cents.\n\n2. **Cost for the remaining 60 minutes:**  \n   \\( 60 \\times 0.5 = 30 \\) cents.\n\n3. **Total cost:**  \n   \\( 18 + 30 = 48 \\) cents.\n\n\\(\\boxed{48}\\)", "model_answer": 48.0, "ground_truth": 48.0, "is_correct": true}
