unces} + 7 \\text{ ounces} = 268 \\text{ ounces}\n   \\]\n\n5. **Water left**:\n   \\[\n   330 \\text{ ounces} - 268 \\text{ ounces} = 62 \\text{ ounces}\n   \\]\n\nThe number of ounces of water left is \\(\\boxed{62}\\).", "model_answer": 62.0, "ground_truth": 62.0, "is_correct": true}
